'''Black Markets''' are unique shops that can be accessed through a [[Crawl Space]]. Black Markets are 2 rooms wide. The left side of the Black Market contains a door back to the crawlspace and a trapdoor or beam of light to the next floor (including the {{s|Dark Room}} or {{s|Chest}}, even if they haven't been unlocked yet). The center of the room contains several items from the [[Shop (Item Pool)|Shop pool]] that can all be bought for 1 Red Heart container. {{dlc|nr}} Although these will not be [[Devil]] Room items, they still count as Devil deals for [[Angel Room#Conditions to Make Angel Rooms Appear|Angel Room generation]] and unlocking {{C|Azazel}}. {{dlc|r}} This is no longer the case, and Isaac can buy items from the Black Market without affecting the spawn chances of Angel rooms. The rest of the room will be strewn about with {{e|Shopkeeper}}s, pickups, and various {{M|Beggar}}s and [[machine]]s.

[[Telepills]], {{i|Undefined}}, and {{dlc+|r+}}{{t|Cursed Penny}} {{dlc-}} have a very small chance to teleport you to the Black Market, but there will be no door exiting back to a {{R|Crawl Space}}. This means that without another way to teleport, the player will be forced to proceed to the next level, like in an {{R|I AM ERROR}} Room.

