{{bug|dlc=na+|Creating and entering a trapdoor which also leads to a Black Market (for example by {{i|We Need To Go Deeper!}} or an {{p|Ehwaz}} rune) results in not being able to escape the Black Market other than going to the next floor.}}
{{bug|dlc=r|Using [[Telepills]] or {{i|Undefined}} to enter a black market in the mirrored world on {{s|Downpour}} II and {{s|Dross}} II will generate a black market with no items and no exits. Without any other means of teleporting, this will softlock a run.}}

